  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Haben Sie Lust auf köstliche Grillgerichte im Departement Ain? Besuchen Sie das Restaurant Courtepaille in Saint Genis Pouilly!"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A wide variety of grills is served in the Courtepaille grill restaurant. For a nice drink, the Avanzi bar welcomes you. You can also snack at any time of the day.\r\nSwimming pool accessible to the customers of the restaurant."
    ],
    "it": [
